{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rootborn</strong> is a quirky action-platformer\u2014basically, a sandbox adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s like the lovechild of <strong>Terraria</strong> and schizophrenia. Brother to <strong>Starbound</strong> and the dirt on your sneakers, inspired by squares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine mixing weird art style, a random story, four cans of booze, and a unhealthy obsession with stacking game blocks. That\u2019s what you get.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game that scares clowns, spiders, and heights (probably).<br>(Okay, maybe not completely, but you get the idea.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game that took 17,000 years and 96 trillions of neurons to make this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game that\u00a0cost about the same as 3 slices of pizzas and a free water cup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game that is the reason its developer is now unemployed and lonely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Rootborn</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089290/2e54565e843bd023a5681705ebce02d3bf92e2b9.jpg"},{"name":"Rocky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089290/77251170231e95c06b311e5066f380b51c6d61e5.jpg"},{"name":"Here we go","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089290/968a042c6aff415a44045c491205f4cdf2046268.jpg"},{"name":"How sharp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089290/9a317e5015b20e62f948f432bb3348eb7b2a7cb6.jpg"},{"name":"Cutie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089290/27b46da0b923234548f41497588a094c70789f16.jpg"},{"name":"Sculptor","path":"https://cdn.a